    "content": "<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; width: 96%; max-width: 760px; margin: 12px auto; padding: 10px; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei','PingFang SC',Arial,sans-serif; background: radial-gradient(circle at top,#6b170d 0%,#280503 42%,#120101 100%); border: 2px solid #e2a636; border-radius: 18px; box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.5),0 0 20px rgba(255,190,60,.15); overflow: hidden;\"><!-- ===== 顶部标题：协调统一 ===== -->\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; padding: 18px 10px 16px; text-align: center; background: linear-gradient(135deg,#5f0704 0%,#a51c0d 50%,#5f0704 100%); border: 1px solid #ffcb61; border-radius: 14px; box-shadow: inset 0 0 20px rgba(255,204,91,.2),0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.35);\">\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 30px; color: #ffd966; line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 4px; text-shadow: 0 2px 3px #000,0 0 10px rgba(255,221,100,.7);\">♛王者计划-①肖①码♛</div>\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold; color: #fff3c1; letter-spacing: 1px; text-shadow: 0 1px 2px #000;\">顶尖大师 <span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #ffe55c;\">058585.com</span></div>\n</div>\n<!-- ===== 237期 ===== -->\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; margin-top: 14px; padding: 14px; background: linear-gradient(145deg,#fff9e8 0%,#fff3cc 100%); border: 2px solid #c9942c; border-radius: 14px; box-shadow: 0 5px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.28);\">\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; padding: 9px 8px; background: linear-gradient(90deg,#7e1008,#c12912,#7e1008); border-radius: 8px; color: #fff;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 3px 10px; color: #5b1208; background: #ffd569; border-radius: 5px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 900;\">第278期</span> <strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 20px; color: #fff7d0;\">①肖②码</strong> <em style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-style: normal; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 900; color: #fff;\">开：蛇02 ⚡</em></div>\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 12px; padding: 13px 8px; text-align: center; font-size: 23px; font-weight: 900; color: #7e0903; background: #fff; border: 1px dashed #d5a23b; border-radius: 9px;\">精准【<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #ff0000; background-color: #ffff00;\">蛇</span>-<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #ff0000; background-color: #ffff00;\">02</span>】分析</div>\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 10px; padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; color: #4c3720; background: rgba(255,255,255,.6); border-left: 4px solid #c99530; border-radius: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">资料不在字多，在于刀刀见血；话不多说，今晚这一注，便是你翻身的起点。</span></div>\n</div>\n<!-- ===== 238期 ===== -->\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; margin-top: 14px; padding: 14px; background: linear-gradient(145deg,#fff9e8 0%,#fff3cc 100%); border: 2px solid #c9942c; border-radius: 14px; box-shadow: 0 5px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.28);\">\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; padding: 9px 8px; background: linear-gradient(90deg,#7e1008,#c12912,#7e1008); border-radius: 8px; color: #fff;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 3px 10px; color: #5b1208; background: #ffd569; border-radius: 5px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 900;\">第279期</span> <strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 20px; color: #fff7d0;\">①肖②码</strong> <em style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-style: normal; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 900; color: #fff;\">开：鸡10 ⚡</em></div>\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 12px; padding: 13px 8px; text-align: center; font-size: 23px; font-weight: 900; color: #7e0903; background: #fff; border: 1px dashed #d5a23b; border-radius: 9px;\">精准【<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #ff0000; background-color: #ffff00;\">鸡</span>-<span style=\"color: #ff0000; background-color: #ffff00;\">10</span>】分析</div>\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 10px; padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; color: #4c3720; background: rgba(255,255,255,.6); border-left: 4px solid #c99530; border-radius: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">全网资料千千万，敢像我们这样提前亮剑的没几个。不是我们狂，是实力不允许低调。</span></div>\n</div>\n<!-- ===== 239期 ===== -->\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; margin-top: 14px; padding: 14px; background: linear-gradient(145deg,#fff9e8 0%,#fff3cc 100%); border: 2px solid #c9942c; border-radius: 14px; box-shadow: 0 5px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.28);\">\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; padding: 9px 8px; background: linear-gradient(90deg,#7e1008,#c12912,#7e1008); border-radius: 8px; color: #fff;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 3px 10px; color: #5b1208; background: #ffd569; border-radius: 5px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 900;\">第280期</span> <strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 20px; color: #fff7d0;\">①肖①码</strong> <em style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-style: normal; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 900; color: #fff;\">开：龙15 ⚡</em></div>\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 12px; padding: 13px 8px; text-align: center; font-size: 23px; font-weight: 900; color: #7e0903; background: #fff; border: 1px dashed #d5a23b; border-radius: 9px;\">精准【虎-17】分析 <br>防<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0); color: rgb(212, 42, 26);\">15</span>.27.02.38</div>\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 10px; padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; color: #4c3720; background: rgba(255,255,255,.6); border-left: 4px solid #c99530; border-radius: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">看资料看的是结果，不是看小说。我们不爱画大饼，只爱数钱到手软，今晚跟紧别掉队。</span></div>\n</div>\n<!-- ===== 239期 ===== -->\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; margin-top: 14px; padding: 14px; background: linear-gradient(145deg,#fff9e8 0%,#fff3cc 100%); border: 2px solid #c9942c; border-radius: 14px; box-shadow: 0 5px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.28);\">\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; padding: 9px 8px; background: linear-gradient(90deg,#7e1008,#c12912,#7e1008); border-radius: 8px; color: #fff;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 3px 10px; color: #5b1208; background: #ffd569; border-radius: 5px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 900;\">第281期</span> <strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 20px; color: #fff7d0;\">①肖①码</strong> <em style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-style: normal; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 900; color: #fff;\">开： 鸡10 ⚡</em></div>\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 12px; padding: 13px 8px; text-align: center; font-size: 23px; font-weight: 900; color: #7e0903; background: #fff; border: 1px dashed #d5a23b; border-radius: 9px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(126, 9, 3); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">精准【</span>牛-18<span style=\"color: #7e0903;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">】分析 </span></span><br><span style=\"color: #7e0903;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">防<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">10</span></span>.22</span></span></div>\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 10px; padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; color: #4c3720; background: rgba(255,255,255,.6); border-left: 4px solid #c99530; border-radius: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">机会是留给有准备的人，但财富是留给敢下手的人。这一把，带你体验什么叫&ldquo;躺赢&rdquo;。</span></div>\n</div>\n<!-- ===== 239期 ===== -->\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; margin-top: 14px; padding: 14px; background: linear-gradient(145deg,#fff9e8 0%,#fff3cc 100%); border: 2px solid #c9942c; border-radius: 14px; box-shadow: 0 5px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.28);\">\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; padding: 9px 8px; background: linear-gradient(90deg,#7e1008,#c12912,#7e1008); border-radius: 8px; color: #fff;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 3px 10px; color: #5b1208; background: #ffd569; border-radius: 5px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 900;\">第282期</span> <strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 20px; color: #fff7d0;\">①肖①码</strong> <em style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-style: normal; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 900; color: #fff;\">开：猴23 ⚡</em></div>\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 12px; padding: 13px 8px; text-align: center; font-size: 23px; font-weight: 900; color: #7e0903; background: #fff; border: 1px dashed #d5a23b; border-radius: 9px;\">精准【龙-27】分析<br>防:19.31.<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00;\">23</span></span>.35</div>\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 10px; padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; color: #4c3720; background: rgba(255,255,255,.6); border-left: 4px solid #c99530; border-radius: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">一份真正的好料，从来不需要锣鼓喧天。懂的人自然懂，这一期的剧本我们已经写好，你只管抄作业。</span></div>\n</div>\n<!-- ===== 239期 ===== -->\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; margin-top: 14px; padding: 14px; background: linear-gradient(145deg,#fff9e8 0%,#fff3cc 100%); border: 2px solid #c9942c; border-radius: 14px; box-shadow: 0 5px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.28);\">\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; padding: 9px 8px; background: linear-gradient(90deg,#7e1008,#c12912,#7e1008); border-radius: 8px; color: #fff;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 3px 10px; color: #5b1208; background: #ffd569; border-radius: 5px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 900;\">第283期</span> <strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 20px; color: #fff7d0;\">①肖①码</strong> <em style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-style: normal; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 900; color: #fff;\">开：發88 ⚡</em></div>\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 12px; padding: 13px 8px; text-align: center; font-size: 23px; font-weight: 900; color: #7e0903; background: #fff; border: 1px dashed #d5a23b; border-radius: 9px;\">精准【 發-88】分析<br><span style=\"color: #7e0903;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">中奖好料不要错过，<br>添加迅聊好友，<br>每天内幕给你分享！</span></span></div>\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 10px; padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; color: #4c3720; background: rgba(255,255,255,.6); border-left: 4px solid #c99530; border-radius: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">跟上我们中奖是不是很简单？速速上车！大奖在向你招手了!</span></div>\n</div>\n<!-- ===== 底部：与顶部视觉协调 ===== -->\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 16px; padding: 14px 8px; text-align: center; background: linear-gradient(135deg,#2d1305,#7d2708,#2d1305); border: 1px solid #e2a636; border-radius: 14px; box-shadow: inset 0 0 12px rgba(255,204,91,.15);\">\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold; color: #fff3c1; letter-spacing: 1px;\">买码之前先上 <span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #ffe55c; font-size: 20px;\">058585.com</span></div>\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 6px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #ffdba4;\">这里期期大公开</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
